  "rationale": "P0 of the sixth droplet forward for methanol, data-informed (not zero-shot): the carried numbers with three laws revised from the physical mechanism: an unlit droplet evaporating on its stored heat, with constants from standard property tables, in place of the typed after-flame transient; the critical diameter capped above 18 % oxygen (5.8 mm in air where the carried law says 9 mm and physics 4.5 mm) and falling with pressure above 1 atm; no pressure term in the water extinction. The flame cameras are not read. Every number typed by the author; no fit, no search; no validation outcome was read.",
  "origin": "system"
